      <h1 id="servicemonitor-monitoring-coreos-com-v1" class="group scroll-mt-20">ServiceMonitor [monitoring.coreos.com/v1]<a href="#servicemonitor-monitoring-coreos-com-v1" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground">
      <p>The <code>ServiceMonitor</code> custom resource definition (CRD) defines how <code>Prometheus</code> and <code>PrometheusAgent</code> can scrape metrics from a group of services. Among other things, it allows to specify:</p>
      <ul>
      <li>The services to scrape via label selectors.</li>
      <li>The container ports to scrape.</li>
      <li>Authentication credentials to use.</li>
      <li>Target and metric relabeling.</li>
      </ul>
      <p><code>Prometheus</code> and <code>PrometheusAgent</code> objects select <code>ServiceMonitor</code> objects using label and namespace selectors.</p>
      </dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><CodeBlock code={"`object`"} lang="plaintext" /></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Required</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><ul><li><code>spec</code></li></ul></dd>
      </dl>
