      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground">
      <p>RelabelConfig allows dynamic rewriting of the label set for targets, alerts, scraped samples and remote write samples.</p>
      <p>More info: https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/configuration/#relabel_config</p>
      </dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
